<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<main class="static-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: 24 October 2026</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account:</strong> username, email and password (stored only as a secure hash). If you sign in with Google, your Google name, email and photo.</li>
    <li><strong>Bookings:</strong> stay dates and the name, age and gender of each guest.</li>
    <li><strong>Listings (hosts):</strong> the details and photos you add.</li>
    <li><strong>Payments:</strong> handled by Razorpay. We never see or store your card or UPI details.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To run your account, bookings, refunds and listings.</li>
    <li>To send account emails (email verification, password reset, listing updates).</li>
    <li>To keep the platform safe and prevent fraud.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We don't sell your data. We share it only with your host (for your booking), our service providers (Razorpay, Cloudinary for photos, our email provider) and authorities when the law requires it.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use one cookie to keep you signed in. No advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Update your username and password from your Profile.</li>
    <li>Request account deletion from your Profile. We then remove your profile, password, wishlist and reviews, and keep only a minimal record (username, email, role, sign-up and deletion dates, your stated reason) for security and to resolve booking or payment disputes.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about your data: <a href="mailto:homekuti247@gmail.com">homekuti247@gmail.com</a></p>
</main>
